  "contract": [
    "Native graph ABI takes destination and input cursor, returns advanced cursor; no imported portable boolean/length API or validation guards. Ordered descriptor copies write352 graph bytes and advance1756 model bytes.",
    "Convolution descriptors preserve eight truncated header bytes, raw scale bits and unsigned full-width grouped arithmetic before truncation. Aligned records round wrapped weight bytes up to4, add bias/state offsets8/24, and preserve cursor-update-before-copy aliasing. Nonzero groups required.",
    "Pool, vector, operator, pair and quantizer helpers preserve exact field layouts and default quantizer0.0/1.0. Pair/quantizer capture raw words and update cursor before output writes.",
    "Every1196 native instruction bytes executes.1605 paired cases include independent complete graph/descriptor/cursor/data oracles, overlapping output/model buffers, dimension overflow and flag truncation, aliases and active FPSCR patterns.",
    "128 lifecycle cases execute actual C session/queues/model constructor/graph/helpers, allocator and complete teardown. Model instance and state allocations coalesce to the prior heap top. Readonly15696-byte resource contents remain equal to stock."
  ],
  "limits": [
    "Seven new opaque executor identity data bindings replace one graph import; these are not callable function ABI definitions. All eleven model/graph executor implementations and inference behavior remain open.",
    "Direct graph/helper comparisons execute compiled C memory primitives and model no function ports. Full heap fixtures retain five external system/logging ports returning via BX LR. Source execution cannot enter stock.",
    "Readonly model pointers are normalized only during complete heap comparison, never rewritten during execution. Large dimension cases establish wrapping record arithmetic, not physically valid large allocations.",
    "Nonzero groups are a precondition of admitted descriptor contracts, as in native graph callers. Divide-by-zero, invalid addresses, cold FP activation, concurrency, caller scratch and physical fault width remain outside proof.",
    "The885-unit ld-r composition has no failures or duplicate strong symbols.874 prior nongenerated source/object pairs unchanged, tested object equals normal object, and no writable state added. Application imports67 to73; boot22.",
    "Final executable linking, startup integration, physical hardware delivery, numerical inference and device boot remain open. The build is relocatable composition, not a bootable image."
  ],
